Z||000010||Indiana_resto_guy||10-06-2001||08:03 AM||||I read the E-Bay posting. Going on that note a couple of questions come to mind. When the key is turned ON, does the check/service engine light come on? If not, replace the bulb in the cluster. Check to see if it works now. If it does, check to see if there are codes stored (do a search in the archives to find out how). Sounds like pure electric from his add and I suspect that the IAC valve is not working. Do that and we will all go to the next step(s).||||reg||1
